.SS
piquelctl app service health http
.PP
Replace the health check with an HTTP check.
.PP
The check sends a \fBGET\fR request to the port inside the container and passes on a 2xx or 3xx status. It needs nothing in the image.
.PP
\fBpiquelctl app service health http\fR [OPTIONS] <APP> <SERVICE> <PORT>
.TP
\fI<APP>\fR
