.TP
\fI<APP>\fR
Application name or stable ID.
.TP
\fI<JOB>\fR
Job name.
.TP
\fI<SERVICE>\fR
Service whose image, environment, secrets, mounts and startup dependencies the job reuses.
.TP
\fI<COMMAND>...\fR
Command the job runs, after \fB\-\-\fR. It replaces the service\*(Aqs command and arguments.
.TP
\fB\-\-deploy\fR
Also deploy the saved configuration to each declared environment that isn\*(Aqt promoted from another.
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-wait\fR
