List, regenerate, or delete an environment\*(Aqs generated secrets.
.PP
\fBpiquelctl env secret\fR [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
.TP
\fBpiquelctl env secret list\fR
List the environment\*(Aqs generated secrets.
.TP
\fBpiquelctl env secret regenerate\fR
Generate a new value for a generated secret.
.TP
\fBpiquelctl env secret delete\fR
Delete a generated secret that nothing uses.
.SS
piquelctl env secret list
