\fB\-\-deployment\fR \fI<ID>\fR
ID of the deployment to wait for. By default, the latest deployment when the command starts.
.TP
\fB\-\-ready\fR \fI<READY>\fR
How ready the deployment must be before the command returns. Default: \fBruntime\fR.
.RS
.TP
\fBruntime\fR
