.TP
\fBpiquelctl preview create\fR
Create a preview of a branch and deploy it.
.TP
\fBpiquelctl preview deploy\fR
Deploy the head of a preview\*(Aqs branch again, or a snapshot of your Git worktree with \fB\-\-local\fR.
.TP
\fBpiquelctl preview list\fR
List an application\*(Aqs previews with their status and branch state.
.TP
\fBpiquelctl preview show\fR
Show one preview, its URLs, and the state of its branch.
.TP
\fBpiquelctl preview logs\fR
Print the most recent lines of a preview\*(Aqs Docker logs.
.TP
\fBpiquelctl preview history\fR
List a preview\*(Aqs deployments, newest first: each one\*(Aqs outcome and where it came from.
.TP
\fBpiquelctl preview attempts\fR
List the attempts of one of a preview\*(Aqs deployments, newest first: each try at rolling it out, how it ended, and when it last changed.
.TP
\fBpiquelctl preview restore\fR
Deploy an earlier, succeeded deployment of a preview again exactly as it ran, without running its jobs.
.TP
\fBpiquelctl preview wait\fR
Wait until a deployment of a preview is ready.
.TP
\fBpiquelctl preview url\fR
Print the URLs of a preview\*(Aqs routes, and whether each is ready.
.TP
\fBpiquelctl preview exec\fR
Run a one\-off command in a running task of a preview\*(Aqs service, streaming its output.
